window.products.push({"id":1093034,"name":"Entertaining with Caspari Christmas Ornaments Paper Dinner Plate Package, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xRJbKJTjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Christmas Ornaments Paper Dinner Plates in ivory represents whimsical Caspari design and feel. This package of 8 10-1/2-inch dinner plates is great for formal and informal entertaining alike. The sturdy paper plates are printed exclusively for Caspari in Germany using enviromently sound raw materials, so you can feel even better about entertaining with their products. These Christmas Ornaments dinner plates are made to resemble fine porcelain. These plates however are 100% disposable, so you can enjoy your time with friends and family more, and clean up less! Look for other products in this pattern too! Bring elegence into your home everyday with the Caspari Christmas Ornaments Dinner Plates. Be creative with Caspari style. Amazon.com Classic or chic, formal or fun, Caspari paper products display a spectacular array of designs. Designed for Caspari by artist Pamela Gladding, these 10-1/2-inch round dinner plates are printed with a striking border of colorful ornaments strung together with swirling red ribbons. The background comes in a choice of ivory, which lends a relaxed feel, or gold, for a more elegant feel. A seasonal, carefree alternative to porcelain, the Christmas Ornaments plates have a light plastic coating for standing up to salad dressing, gravy, and sauces, perfect for dinner parties where minimal cleanup is desired. A matching salad plate with an all-over ornament design is available, as are napkins in three sizes for a fully coordinated table. Caspari is committed to environmentally sound practices. Much of the paper used in Caspari products comes from a company that utilizes 100% wind power for its electricity and uses fibers from sustainably harvested trees. No chlorine is used in the bleaching process, and the beautiful designs are printed with non-toxic, water-soluble dyes. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xRJbKJTjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B000VL2R7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VL2R7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VL2R7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
