window.products.push({"id":1093457,"name":"Food Kitchen Scale, Food Scales Digital Weight Grams and Oz, High Precision Digital Scale, Baking, Cooking, Tare Function, with 2 Trays, LCD Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-f9pHH+OL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Accurate Measurement】 Whether you are baking or cooking, you can use this digital food scale for accurate ingredient weighing. It can accurately measure a range of weights from 0.1 grams to 3000 grams with a margin of error of no more than 0.01 grams. It allows you to create delicious dishes and pastries with confidence, presenting perfect results every time. 【Excellent Quality】 The kitchen scale features a premium stainless steel platform and plastic frame for outstanding durability and reliability. It also comes with two different size trays to meet the weighing needs of different ingredients. Long time use will not affect its quality, so you don't need to worry about the service life. 【Easily Portable】 The food scale has a miniature design, easy to store and carry, can be easily placed in the kitchen drawer or carried to the outdoor use. It's compact and easy to carry around and doesn't take up much space, making your kitchen more organized and tidy. Whether you are cooking at home or having a picnic outdoors, it can provide you with accurate weighing services. 【9 Unit Conversions】 This digital scale features 9 unit conversions, with smart unit buttons to quickly switch between gn/oz/ozt/dwt/ct/lb/tl/g/ml and other units at will to meet the needs of different regions and occasions. No more need to manually calculate the conversion between different units, the convenient and quick operation makes it easier for you to complete the baking or cooking process. 【Wide Application Range】 This digital kitchen scale is a versatile electronic scale that is not only suitable for home kitchens, but also for weighing in jewelry and other fields. It has accurate weighing capacity and multiple measurement units to meet the needs of different fields. Whether you are cooking and baking at home, or weighing in the jewelry industry, it provides accuracy and reliability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-f9pHH+OL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dwedum","source_asin":"B0C8N25BDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8N25BDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8N25BDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
