window.products.push({"id":1093482,"name":"SetSail Silicone Toilet Brush, Toilet Bowl Brush and Holder Toilet Scrubber with Silicone Bristles Flat Flexible Toilet Brushes for Bathroom with Hold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dl6nO55qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ATTENTION: Although silicone bristles have many advantages, it does not easy to remove stubborn stains compared with a normal PP brush head, we recommend using it together with toilet cleaner. NO DEAD CORNER CLEANING: With flat, different-sided brush heads, bendable and multifunctional, can be reached under the rim of the toilet bowl by bending the head upward. Also can use to clean narrow gaps. SILICONE BRUSH HEAD: With silicone brush heads, rust-free, more durable, and long-lasting than normal brush heads; no hair-tangling and dirt-attached troubles, easy to wash, and not scratch your toilet bowl. DRY QUICKLY & DRIPPING-FREE: Double-layer toilet brush holder is more sturdy and ventilated, keeping the brush head drying quickly. And the detachable base is dripping-free, keeping your floor clean and neat. 100% AFTER-SALE SERVICE: If you experience an issue with our product, get in touch with us to repair or replace it. We’re grateful for the opportunity to learn from your experience, and we’ll make it better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dl6nO55qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SetSail","source_asin":"B09WYGL664","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WYGL664","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WYGL664","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1093483,"name":"Laura Ashley Home - King Comforter Set, Reversible Cotton Bedding with Matching Shams, Stylish Home Decor for All Seasons (Chloe Blue, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":153.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JFVJOjVOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Garden inspiration brings natural beauty to any space, making Laura Ashley’s floral designs a perfect decorating choice. This beautiful blue and white watercolor print gives the classic garden floral a modern update with its relaxed painterly style and sophisticated grey accents. The ruffled comforter and shams are printed on a crisp white cotton pique weave, offering added textural interest and distinctive style. Embroidered and ruffled decorative accent pillows and coordinating ruffled European shams allow you to create a luxurious bedroom with a decorator’s touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JFVJOjVOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B088LH8PHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LH8PHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LH8PHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1093484,"name":"Farielyn-X Set of 12 Christmas Glossy Reusable Grocery Bag, Tote Bag with Handle, Non-woven Stylish Gift Bag, Goodies Bag, Shopping Promotional Bag (R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JYvBzNZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Farielyn-X Non-woven Gift Bag - Trendy, Special and Multifunctional! What It Is? New Non-woven Fabric Bag - Glossy and Reusable New Non-woven Fabric Bag - Glossy and Reusable Two comfortable handles for easy and enjoyable carrying. Two comfortable handles for easy and enjoyable carrying. Foldable design in portable size ensures a convenient & pleasing use. Foldable design in portable size ensures a convenient & pleasing use. Versatile for All - A pretty and reliable helper for packing presents, shopping or using on any parties. Versatile for All - A pretty and reliable helper for packing presents, shopping or using on any parties. More Detail Information Material: Non-woven Fabric Material: Non-woven Fabric Color:Rose Gold Color:Rose Gold Size: 12.7’’ x 4.7’’ x 11.1’’(L x W x H) Size: 12.7’’ x 4.7’’ x 11.1’’(L x W x H) Package Content: 12 x Gift Bag Package Content: 12 x Gift Bag A New Type - You Just Can’t Say No! - Reusable Material: Compared with paper gift bags, this non-woven bag with sleek coating is much stronger, sleeker, more dust-proof and water-resistant to use. - Three different color to choose Convenient to Use - Two comfortable handles let you carry it anywhere with ease. - Helpful for all: Designed in a regular size 12.7’’ x 4.7’’ x 11.1’’ (L x W x H), this reusable bag can fit great with most presents, clothes, goodies etc, wonderful for packing presents, shopping and using on kinds of parties. Easily Meet Your Needs 12 gift bags are offered together, giving you a big hand on any occasions, like shopping, wedding, housewarming, going to school or work etc. Also very nice to share it with your beloveds!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JYvBzNZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Farielyn-X","source_asin":"B07ZGNC1ZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZGNC1ZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZGNC1ZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1093485,"name":"Plastic Microwave Plate Cover Spatter Guard with Steam Vented Clear Lid (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FVs55393L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Forget the foil! Put down that plastic wrap! Toss out your paper towels! The Microwave Plate Cover is all you need to make perfectly prepared microwave meals, anytime! Simply place this cool contoured plate cover right over food on a plate, pop it in the microwave, and voila! Dinner is served! The plate cover is made from durable, dishwasher-safe transparent plastic, and features an adjustable Vapor Vent so you can control how much steam is released. This means food will cook more evenly, and you’ll be faced with fewer soggy leftovers. Plus, you’ll never have to hassle with annoying plastic wrap again! For the price of a roll of wrap you can have a more effective, less wasteful, and easier to use food cover solution! Pick up yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FVs55393L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microwave","source_asin":"B084YQ2KL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084YQ2KL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084YQ2KL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
