window.products.push({"id":1093570,"name":"SUNNY BIRD Insulated Lunch Bag with Foldable and Leakproof Design, Thermally Insulated, Shoulder Strap for Women, Men and Teen (Black 002)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711KCCaAb3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Foldable and Portable] It may be folded into a pouch after use and thrown into any tote bag, backpack, or work bag. This soft insulated bag is machine washable and can be folded into a 2.5-inch square for storage (do not tumble dry). It can be your reused as grocery cooler bag, which is ideal for buying groceries or for the farmers market when you need to keep dairy milk, cheese, or flowers fresh [Thermally Insulated and Leakproof] This cooler bag has a PEVA foil interior lining, 4mm thick insulated EPE foam padding, and 900D polyester exterior fabric protection. With this triple insulation, your food will stay cool, comfortable, fresh, and safe for 6 to 8 hours with superior protection from dirt splatters or light rain. Additionally, the bag's seamless hot-pressing lining makes it leakproof and makes any sauce drips or spills simple to clean up [Medium Capacity with Lots of Space] It measures 9.25 x 6.5 x 6.5 inches in size, with a 6.4-liter capacity, or around 8 cans of 330-ml soda. You may pack food and snacks for the entire day as well as other minor everyday necessities like keys, cards, phone chargers, napkins, water bottles, cutlery, and treats in its one main zippered compartment, one front mesh pocket, one back pocket, two mesh side pockets, and one internal mesh pocket [New Features & Wide-Open-Flap] Your lunch containers may be carried in and out of the bag horizontally without tilting thanks to the top flap's 9 x 6.25-inch size. For simple access, a dual zipper closure option is given. We care about customers opinions, this is a new model 002 with more zippers and Velcro closure to keep your items stay in place. [Compact yet Versatile] This robust, lightweight unisex lunch bag is small and portable. To free up your hands, a removable and adjustable shoulder strap (length range: 15 to 28 inches) is offered. You can wear it crossbody, dangle it on your shoulder, or hold it in your hands. Perfect for picnics, day trips, working from home, attending classes on campus, and going to the beach while on the go! This product is recommended for individuals aged 5 and above.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711KCCaAb3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUNNY BIRD","source_asin":"B09QM8LBH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QM8LBH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QM8LBH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
