window.products.push({"id":1093615,"name":"1.5 oz Hexagon Mini Glass Jars with Gold Lids and Labels (Pack of 24)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s4hDpboML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"These 24 small glass jars with gold lids are each 1.5 ounces. Two types of labels are included, circular and rectangular. The rectangular labels are intended for the sides of the jars, the circular labels work best on the tops of the jars. The gold lids screw onto the jars securely, and are easy to open without too much force. The jars are packed securely in a divided box for safe shipping. The jars are made of strong food safe glass. The jars and lids are safe for the dishwasher. The hexagon shape of the jars makes it easy to store them next to each other without any wasted space. The jars can be used to store many things and are ideal for small samples or gifts. Wedding favors, baby food, honey, custom spice blends, herbs, samples of jams or jelly, homemade candles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s4hDpboML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homemade Perfect","source_asin":"B06XT62RV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XT62RV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XT62RV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1093616,"name":"Pinelive TriSlot Recipe Box with Cards and Dividers - Rustic Wood Recipe Box with 76 Blank Recipe Cards 4x6, 8x Dividers and Measurements. For Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fYY5XDNgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFULLY USEFUL: Not only is the TriSlot Wooden Recipe Box beautiful to look at with its vintage finish and unique “wood panel look” on top, but it also comes with 76 beautiful double-sided recipe cards, 8 cute recipe card dividers, and a useful measuring card. Use these recipe cards and box for bridal shower keepsakes, or beloved family recipes because we crafted it to be a work of art for both! WITH RECIPE STAND: When you’re working with beloved recipes, the last thing you want is them getting ripped and dirty. So we fitted this Recipe Card Box with THREE slots along the top to hold all your culinary secrets as you cook. You can even fit laminated recipe box cards as well as recipe index cards stored in plastic sleeves because the slots are 1.6mm and able to hold a thick card, unlike other boxes. LARGE SIZE: This index card holder is the one with the most space you’ve seen today! It’s 7.1” wide x 6.9” depth x 5.3” tall with inside dimensions 6.3”wide x 6.2” depth x 5” tall. It fits 350+ 6x4 index cards with room to spare for laminated index cards or those stored in protectors And everyone agrees the extra space is exactly what they want! This storage box also includes 76 cards (6x4”) and 8 dividers (6x5” including the tabs). CRAFTED FOR LIFE: We choose high-grade pine for our wood card box because of its beautiful rustic grain and affordability Your box is firmly nailed AND glued for long term sturdiness. Your recipe cards are thick 300 gsm card. So you can use any pen without worry. Your divider index cards are laminated but feature a writable tab so you can choose your categories! CREATED FOR GIFTING: A unique way to use a farmhouse recipe box like this is to create a “recipe for a happy marriage” as a keepsake for a new bride to be. But you might like to fill yours with secret family recipes as a Christmas gift! The TriSlot Recipe Holder also comes with a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee and is boxed up for a risk free gift. And hey, why not gift this beautiful organization to YOUR recipes too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fYY5XDNgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PINELIVE","source_asin":"B081ZG3LQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081ZG3LQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081ZG3LQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
