window.products.push({"id":1093657,"name":"Bamboo Kitchen Drawer Organizer, Expandable Silverware Tray and Utensils Holder, Wooden Cutlery Tray with Grooved Divider for Flatware Spoon Fork Kniv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xMs4cCFmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superior design solution】This telescopic silverware tray can expand up to 15.35 x 14.17 inches, which provides extra storage capacity to accommodate multiple eating and cooking utensils. With each compartment 1.97\" deep，the silverware tray Increases storage capacity in your kitchen drawer to best fit a variety of utensils (internal depth 1.38’’). 【Perfect for storage】This outstanding bamboo kitchen drawer storage box for large tableware and cutlery is an absolute necessity in any kitchen. There are 7 compartments for storing spoons, knives, forks and cutlery, as well as other various items like jewelry, office supplies, cosmetics, manual tools, personal accessories etc. 【Expandable & practical】This silverware tray expands from 5 slots to 7 slots to easily store flatware, utensils and other kitchen gadgets. This bamboo expandable drawer organizer allows you to use it in the kitchen, office, bedroom or in any other room you want. 【Eco-friendly Materials】This cutlery tray is made of beautiful water-resistant Moso bamboo which is environmentally friendly, elegant, and durable to stands the test of time. Food-safe finish on all surfaces and gentle for cutlery and utensils. 【Easy maintenance】Bamboo is not only gentler on knives than plastic but also easier to clean and maintain than hardwood. this bamboo organizer can be wipe quickly with warm water and be simply wiped down with a damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xMs4cCFmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda Eye","source_asin":"B09H2LS9PF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H2LS9PF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H2LS9PF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1093658,"name":"Sukha Home Wash Your Palms Wood Bathroom Sign, Palm Tree Decor, Beach Themed Bathroom Decor, Beachy Decorations Home Decor, Coastal Shelf or Wall Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q7K41BMyL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"?? WHY WE LOVE IT NO MORE DIRTY PALMS, AKA HANDS: A beachy decor reminder to wash after you wipe ?? Keeping those palms nice and clean! HOME DECOR: Great for beach bathroom accessories or coastal kitchen decor. This light weight wood box is easy to hang on walls. It is also free standing for shelf decor or to sit on the counter. BEACH OR OCEAN COTTAGE ACCESSORIES: Perfect to a decorate a small half bath or guest bathroom. Add some unique decorations to your coastal seashell bathroom. MAKES A GREAT GIFT: Give a unique, funny and decorative home decor gift! Great for Birthdays, Holidays, Housewarming and more! VERSATILE BEACH DECOR STYLE: This simple and stylish wash your palms sign goes great with your beach theme home decor: Farmhouse, Beachy Barnyard, Cottage, Classic, Antique or Vintage Coordinates well with all beach themes: coastal, nautical, ocean, sea, shells, seashell, fish, starfish, mermaid, turtles, flip flops, surfer, whales, dolphin , turtles - We gotcha covered! Great for decorating small spaces, kitchens, half baths, guest bathrooms, laundry rooms and more! PACKAGE DETAILS: 1 Wash Your Palms Decorative Wood Box. Made of MDF particle board. Measures in size approx.5H x 7L X 1.5W Antique finish, blue box with white writing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q7K41BMyL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sukha Home","source_asin":"B097G212K7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097G212K7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097G212K7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1093659,"name":"Alen BreatheSmart Classic H13 HEPA Air Purifier, Air Purifiers For Home Large Room w/ 1100 SqFt Coverage, Medical-Grade Air Cleaner for Mold & Bacteri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818jdGGB-8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silver FILTER: Upgrade Alen True HEPA air filter for the BreatheSmart Classic air purifier. HEPA layer captures 99.9% of airborne particles down to 0.1 micron, helping to capture allergens, dust, pollen, mold, and bacteria. Activated carbon layer captures smoke and household odors within in areas up to 1100 SqFt every 30 minutes. CUSTOMIZING YOUR FILTER: With Alen BreatheSmart Classic Air Purifier, you can customize the air filtration system that suits your needs. We offer air filter options with various designer front panels for our customers' unique concerns. AIR QUALITY DISPLAY: Our Smart Sensor has a 3-color LED display that updates in real-time: Blue, Orange, and Red. When enabled, its ozone-safe ionizer, produces negative ions, which attract and clump ultra-fine particles together to trap dirty air. FOR YOUR COMFORT AND CONVENIENCE: Our Classic air purifier produces pink noise that sounds like gentle rainfall. 4 CFM speeds: Speed 1: 150, Speed 2: 185, Speed 3: 225, Turbo: 290 . Noise levels: Lowest Speed 42 dBa, Highest Speed 56 dBa. FOR DIFFERENT APPLICATIONS: Alen's Classic air purifiers can be used for various scenarios like back-to-school classroom preparations, doctor's offices, hotels, bars, lounges, restaurants, and, most importantly, your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818jdGGB-8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alen","source_asin":"B018N4DAVA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018N4DAVA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018N4DAVA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1093660,"name":"Calphalon Commercial Hard-Anodized 3-Quart All-Around Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316GJCJAQSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com This 3-quart all-around pan will become the most used piece of cookware in your kitchen. The pans high sides and the lids domed shape make it ideal for moist-heat cooking and, with a capacity of 3 quarts, this pan can accommodate Sweet and Sour Chicken, a hearty beef stew, or steamed kale for a family of four. Part of Calphalon's Commercial Hard-Anodized line of cookware, this casserole is made of heavy-gauge aluminum that's uniformly thick across the bottom and sides, allowing for quick and even heat distribution. Its durable hard-anodized finish is stick- and scratch-resistant and wont react with acidic foods. The patented cast stainless-steel handles are comfortable to grip, plus they minimize heat transfer so handles stay cool on the stovetop. Handles are held in place by three sturdy stainless-steel rivets and the included lid is hard-anodized. The cookware is oven-safe up to 450 degrees F, so this dish can easily go from stovetop to oven when preparing, for example, a frittata. All cookware in this line is covered by a lifetime warranty. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316GJCJAQSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00008W70C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008W70C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008W70C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
