window.products.push({"id":1093712,"name":"Tangkula 16 Cubes Storage Organizer, DIY Plastic PP Closet Cabinet w/Rustproof Steel Frame, Portable DIY Modular Storage System w/Hammer for Toys, Boo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b3fM9k4eL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Sturdy & Durable Material: Made of high quality PP plastic panel, the storage cabinet is wear proof and durable for long term use. More, the rustproof powder-coated steel frame enhances the stability and sturdiness. And the ABS connectors tightly combine the whole cabinet and avoid wobble. Besides, the high foot connectors can keep the organizer at a distance from floor and prevent moisture. 16-Cube Storage Space: The size of this storage organizer is 49.5” X 13” X 50.5” (L X W X H), and each cube is 12.5” X 12” X12.5” (L X W X H), which offers enough space to store or display your toys, books, clothes and anything you want. And the open storage design makes it convenience to sort or take your items. Please note: each cube can holds up to 22lbs. DIY for Variety Shapes: The storage organizer comes with 16 cubes, which can be combined in different shapes according to your needs. Also, you can add or reduce the cube freely in separate position or ladder shape. It is flexible enough to fit into any decoration or limited spaces and be a great addition to your family home. Modern Style for Versatility: This stylish storage cabinet is built from matte black panel, which adds a charm to your room. With large storage space, the storage organizer can be used as a bookcase, storage shelf, storage closet, toy cabinet and other storage cabinet in your bedroom, bathroom, living room, child’s room and anywhere you need. Easy to Assemble & Clean: The lightweight storage cabinet can be assembled effortlessly according to the easy to follow instruction. You only need connect the panel with connectors by using a hammer included in the package. Besides, the whole storage cabinet is waterproof and rustproof, which make it simple to clean and maintain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b3fM9k4eL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B08CGBKX73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1093712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CGBKX73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CGBKX73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
